  "releaseNotes": "1.6.1: Maintenance release with no API or behaviour changes; contents are identical to 1.6.0.\n1.6.0: Fixed UseFlowValidation() silently skipping actions whose action name differs from their method name (an Async-suffixed method, or an action renamed with [ActionName]), and two controllers sharing a class name in different namespaces colliding onto the same validator. The body parameter is now resolved from the matched endpoint's own ControllerActionDescriptor instead of the controller/action route values.",
